OL,3,GNEWSA'Playing table tennis has helped
OL,4,Amy Parkinson's'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living with Parkinson's Disease
OL,7,Fin East Sussex have described the
OL,8,Fbenefits of playing table tennis at
OL,9,Fspecial weekly sessions.
OL,11,FCarol Gill was diagnosed with
OL,12,FParkinson's 11 years ago said playing
OL,13,Fthe game was challenging, but helped
OL,14,Fimprove movement, mood and confidence.
OL,16,F"The game is so fast, so for people
OL,17,Fwith Parkinson's that's a really
OL,18,Fexceptional thing to try," she said.
